                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I loved the OG Beatbuddy... and I got this thinking it would focus on music and be a cool rhythm game for my little Junior.\nUnfortunately seems to be a cashgrab due to lack of polish, bad gameplay implementation, feels rushed and lazy. Could not enjoy the music due to \"gameplay\", even my then non-experienced Junior did not like it... stopped playing at the second level.\nDisappointed. :(",
